  "note": "0.6 (Osama, 7 November 2026). Recon helicopters: separate cards in the recon tab, availability 4, not transports. Each is a copy of the helicopter card (model, portrait, icon, armor, ECM) with the listed options only. Names use Razvedchik (scout), as in T-90M Razvedchik. Defense Forces: Ka-60 Razvedchik, unarmed, 4 seats, no cargo, Very Good optics, 60; Ka-226T Razvedchik, Good optics, 4 seats, 45. Coastal Troops: Ka-29 Razvedchik, 4 seats, Very Good optics, 60, guns and rockets but no ATGM. Motorized Infantry: Mi-24K Razvedchik, S-8 pods +10 each (was +30), 70 like the Mi-24K. VDV Brigade and Guard Tank Brigade: Mi-8AMTSh Razvedchik, Very Good optics, 60, gun and rocket options only. Mi-24K price and the Mi-8AMTSh 4 seats are guesses. Not yet run in a game. The Mi-8AMTSh copy also leaves out the Igla-S and Verba x4 pylons, which no vanilla option uses. dev.31 (Osama): the Ka-29 Razvedchik inner pylons and the Mi-8AMTSh Razvedchik middle pylons get an Empty choice (+0, the empty pylon turret 160 on the same mounts), as the default; vanilla had no empty choice there, so the S-8 (+30) was forced and both cards opened at 90. dev.69 (Osama, 8 November 2026): VDV Brigade Mi-28NM Razvedchik (unit 747), a copy of the Mi-28NM Mikhalych with only empty or rocket pylons (inner: empty, new on this card, S-8 or S-13; outer: empty, S-8 or S-13; no LMUR, Vikhr or Igla), gun kept, Exceptional optics as the Mi-28NM, 90 with empty pylons by default.",
